// A timed effect (ADR 0006, ADR 0024): a trip leaves its target reeling, so
// blows at it land a fifth more often and it can't dodge perfectly. The
// name completes the messages: "The goblin starts reeling."
(
    components: [
        Name("reeling"),
        OffBalance(hit_bp: 2000),
        Duration(300),
    ],
)
